---
// src/components/sections/MonitorIntroSection.astro
---

<section class="monitor-intro">
    <div class="monitor-intro__header">
      <p>Monitor / V1</p>
      <p>Sin dispositivo conectado</p>
    </div>
  
    <div class="monitor-intro__content">
      <div class="monitor-intro__reading">
        <p class="monitor-intro__value">--%</p>
        <p class="monitor-intro__status">Sin lectura</p>
      </div>
  
      <div class="monitor-intro__description">
        <h1>La interfaz espera un dato real.</h1>
  
        <p>
          Cuando el ESP32 pueda enviar una medición válida, este espacio mostrará
          la humedad del suelo y su estado interpretado.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .monitor-intro {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-rows: auto 1fr;
  
      min-height: calc(100svh - var(--header-height));
      padding: 1.25rem;
    }
  
    .monitor-intro__header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  
    .monitor-intro__header p {
      margin: 0;
  
      font-size: 0.6875rem;
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
  
    .monitor-intro__content {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.5fr) minmax(18rem, 1fr);
      align-items: end;
      gap: 4rem;
    }
  
    .monitor-intro__value {
      margin: 0;
  
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(9rem, 24vw, 24rem);
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 0.7;
      letter-spacing: -0.07em;
    }
  
    .monitor-intro__status {
      margin: 2rem 0 0;
  
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
  
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
  
    .monitor-intro__description {
      padding-top: 1.25rem;
  
      border-top: 1px dashed rgb(247 247 243 / 30%);
    }
  
    .monitor-intro__description h1 {
      max-width: 9ch;
      margin: 0;
  
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5rem);
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 0.9;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }
  
    .monitor-intro__description p {
      max-width: 30rem;
      margin: 2rem 0 0;
  
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
  
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
  
    @media (max-width: 48rem) {
      .monitor-intro {
        padding: 1rem;
      }
  
      .monitor-intro__header {
        gap: 1rem;
      }
  
      .monitor-intro__content {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        align-content: end;
        gap: 3rem;
      }
  
      .monitor-intro__reading {
        padding-top: 2rem;
      }
  
      .monitor-intro__value {
        font-size: clamp(8rem, 40vw, 13rem);
        line-height: 0.82;
      }
  
      .monitor-intro__description h1 {
        max-width: 8ch;
        font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 14vw, 5.5rem);
      }
    }
  </style>